WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
What's up guys, we're Pongfinity!

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.720
Today we're playing a match to 21 points,

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.420
and after each point we'll be adding one peace of clothing.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.920
This is gonna get sweaty! 

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.120
Good luck! Good luck!

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.140
We have chosen the hottest day of Finnish summer to films this video.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.660
If you don't sweat enough in normal table tennis, this will get you sweaty!

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.240
Allright, so the first item, the brand new Sensei t-shirt!

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.540
I'm looking forward to putting this on!

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:36.720
Yess!

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.400
Doubleshorts! I don't think I've ever done this before.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.300
Sensei is still cooled down here.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.920
No I'm not!

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.720
Making the Sensei move for a change.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.100
I'm not feeling too happy about putting more clothes on.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.920
Next point I'm going to lose on purpose!

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.740
Nice one!
Noo I don't want to win the point!

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.300
But yes it's a Pongfinity bandana I can get this off.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.020
Where can you get this?
pongfinity.store

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:15.800
Aaah good old Pongfinity bandana.

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.920
Oh no I missed!

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.140
You get to put some clothes on!

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:25.960
I'll put my favorite Sensei t-shirt, the purple one.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.920
That looks very nice!
It's my favorite color.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:31.540
You can get yours from fanjoy.co/pongfinity.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.400
Sensei!

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.620
Oh no this is the worst!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.880
I hope you guys are more excited to put this on 

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.780
when you get it from our store than what I am to put it on now!

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.240
This is where the nightmare starts!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.520
But the design is very cool.

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.320
*Evil laugh*

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:58.240
Tactic is working perfectly!

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:04.960
I don't know what I'm doing!

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.180
Second pair of shorts.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.000
Yeah no problem.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:17.700
Three t-shirts on.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:27.220
Now he wasn't trying to get it on, he just wanted to slap me.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.780
My favorite t-shirt!
Who remembers this?

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:32.140
Comment which video this t-shirt has been used in.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.840
Miikka's favorite shot!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.980
The t-shirt works!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.260
Or actually...

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.740
It's got the breathing hole.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:52.720
No!

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.940
Sensei with the bandana.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.080
Bravo bravo!

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.160
Looking good!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.920
Now that I have warmed up I can start doing the footwork.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.540
Lets see that!

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.100
I couldn't take it serious!

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.720
He looks like he's in a gang or something.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.240
It's a bit tight from here but...

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.040
This one is going to be fun.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.540
My favorite underpants!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.480
What? What are you laughing at Otto?
Nothing.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.620
You got a problem with my outfit?

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.180
No, no I don't.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.240
Time for some more merch!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:52.600
This is turning out to be a great advert for our clothing.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.600
Pongfinity cap.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.240
It suits you this whole outfit quite well.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:58.980
Especially this one.
Yeah!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.860
Miikka's new summer look!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:07.420
Yeah summer 2021, this is the look to go for!

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.020
That's why you never play with a cap on!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.620
I think that's a point for me.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:21.240
Look at him!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.020
I wouldn't want to face Otto on a dark street!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.440
Ooh the underpants.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.100
He's not so scary anymore!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.300
But again like in a weird way it actually suits you.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.680
Thank you!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.440
Or actually it doesn't.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.540
This is going to ruin my fashion look.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.920
Now you look like a baseball player or something.

00:04:53.669 --> 00:04:56.400
Ooh. The backhand flip is going well today.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:58.420
Looking good!

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.560
Scared to serve anything now!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:05.980
Look at Otto.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:11.000
Throwback to the sumo suit video.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:13.740
I feel the same.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:20.900
Sorry!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.120
My favorite one.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.340
Oh my god I can't see anything.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.600
Okay if my footwork isn't fast now then it will never be fast.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.180
I can't see the ball!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:39.000
Okay lets even it out.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:43.100
Enough of showing off the classes Otto, I'm getting a bit hot.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.680
You want to put some more clothes on?

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.120
I'd gladly put some more clothes on.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.560
Noo how can I miss that!

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.660
Around the net glasses.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:53.980
Around the net vision.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:58.000
I see like a digital screen like ,  *dididi* now!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.600
Buy them from pongfinity.store!
Maybe in twenty years.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.940
Oh now you're matching like brothers!

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:21.940
Uuh nice!

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:25.180
Oh tie!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.240
Nice purple tie as well.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.600
Otto do you want to come and tie it for me?

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.860
Feel like I'm going to a big event, suiting up.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:37.000
A very weird Christmas party.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.220
